    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present 48 Blueberry Fields, a 3 bed, 3 bath semi-detached home extending to approximately 93 sq. m. (1,015 sq. ft.). Built in 2007, this property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation, a private rear garden and is ideally positioned within the sought-after Broomfield development.\r\nBroomfield is one of Midleton's most desirable residential areas, Midleton town centre is within walking distance and provides an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, supermarkets, and leisure facilities. The nearby Midleton Train Station offers regular services to Cork City, while the N25 provides easy access to the Jack Lynch Tunnel, Little Island & Carrigtwohill. \r\nAccommodation: Entrance Hall, Guest W.C, Sitting Room, Kitchen/ Dining Area, 3 Bedrooms (1 ensuite) and Family Bathroom. \r\n(Circa 1,015 sq ft)\r\nGuide Price: €295,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nEntrance Hall:\tSemi-solid wood flooring. \r\n\r\nGuest toilet:\tWC and wash hand basin.  Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\tFront aspect with bay window, open fireplace and semi-solid wood flooring. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: \tFully fitted kitchen with free standing washing machine, fridge/freezer, dishwasher, integrated oven & hob. Tiled flooring.  Sliding doors to rear garden.\t\t\t \r\nUpstairs:\t \r\nLanding:                    Carpeted landing area with attic access.\r\nMaster Bedroom:\tFront aspect with semi-solid wood flooring & built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nEnsuite:\tW.C., wash hand basin & electric shower.  Shower area and floor tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\tRear aspect with semi-solid wood flooring and built in wardrobe. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 3:\tFront aspect with semi-solid wood flooring and built in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nFamily bathroom:\tWC, wash hand basin, bath and over-head shower attachment. Floor and bath area tiled. \r\n\r\nOutside:\tTo the rear of the property is a private, enclosed garden with a garden shed and lawn area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tG.F.C.H.\r\n•\tWhite PVC double glazed windows.\r\n•\tFreshly painted and cleaned.\r\n•\tSmoke alarms fitted.\r\n•\tLocated in Cul de Sac.\r\n•\tBER: C BER No:105383541\r\n•\tRear garden, not overlooked.\r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows throughout.\r\n•\tClose to Midleton Train Station with regular services to Cork City.\r\n•\tAmple communal parking adjacent to the property.\r\n•\tWithin walking distance of Midleton town centre, schools, shops, cafés and local amenities.\r\n•\tEircode: P25 F309."
      },
